WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:10.770
&gt;&gt;&gt; It's just heartbreaking to

00:00:10.904 --> 00:00:12.472
see what happened to him.

00:00:12.606 --> 00:00:14.074
I'm broken-hearted.

00:00:14.407 --> 00:00:16.076
I've been crying for the last

00:00:16.409 --> 00:00:18.678
few days knowing he's no longer

00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:21.148
here to share all of his

00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:22.816
inspiration and his prayers and

00:00:22.949 --> 00:00:23.383
everything with us.

00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:25.752
&gt;&gt; That was a grieving

00:00:25.886 --> 00:00:26.486
parishioners talking about how

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.588
the death of a catholic bishop

00:00:28.722 --> 00:00:29.990
has affected her and her

00:00:30.423 --> 00:00:30.490
community.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.491
David O'Connell was shot and

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:34.427
killed over the weekend at his

00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:36.029
home near Los Angeles.

00:00:36.429 --> 00:00:37.497
Authorities have a man in

00:00:37.631 --> 00:00:42.435
custody, and they say the

00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:44.704
attacker knew him.

00:00:44.838 --> 00:00:48.842
&gt;&gt; The person of interest was

00:00:48.975 --> 00:00:51.711
identified as Carlos Medina, the

00:00:51.845 --> 00:00:53.547
husband of bishop O'Connell's

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:53.980
housekeeper.

00:00:54.114 --> 00:00:56.449
&gt;&gt; Let's go to CNN's Josh

00:00:56.449 --> 00:00:57.150
Campbell who is live in los

00:00:57.284 --> 00:00:59.252
Angeles up and early this

00:00:59.386 --> 00:00:59.586
morning.

00:00:59.719 --> 00:01:01.254
Josh, what more are you learning

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:02.055
about what happened here?

00:01:02.455 --> 00:01:05.592
I know there are so many people

00:01:05.725 --> 00:01:07.093
heartbroken that this bishop has

00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:07.527
been killed.

00:01:07.661 --> 00:01:08.828
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Sarah, good morning

00:01:08.962 --> 00:01:10.997
to you.

00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:12.732
65-year-old Carlos Medina was

00:01:12.866 --> 00:01:14.768
arrested yesterday by a los

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:15.869
Angeles sheriff's department

00:01:16.002 --> 00:01:17.003
tactical team after an hours'

00:01:17.137 --> 00:01:18.638
long standoff.

00:01:18.772 --> 00:01:20.874
Authorities say bishop David

00:01:21.007 --> 00:01:23.410
O'Connell who was renowned for

00:01:23.543 --> 00:01:27.447
his work as a community piece

00:01:27.581 --> 00:01:28.481
maker was found dead Saturday in

00:01:28.481 --> 00:01:28.548
his home.

00:01:29.082 --> 00:01:32.152
A deacon went to check on him

00:01:32.485 --> 00:01:34.487
after the bishop was late for a

00:01:34.487 --> 00:01:34.621
meeting.

00:01:34.754 --> 00:01:36.489
The unidentified person told

00:01:36.489 --> 00:01:38.491
police that Medina had been

00:01:38.491 --> 00:01:39.593
acting strange and made comments

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:42.495
about the bishop owing him

00:01:42.495 --> 00:01:42.862
money.

00:01:42.996 --> 00:01:45.165
Detectives were also able to

00:01:45.298 --> 00:01:46.833
gather surveillance footage near

00:01:46.967 --> 00:01:50.503
the crime scene which showed an

00:01:50.503 --> 00:01:52.672
SUV pushing into the driveway

00:01:52.806 --> 00:01:54.040
and departing later.

00:01:54.174 --> 00:01:55.909
The motive right now is unclear

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:57.277
and although there have been

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.112
reports of some type of

00:01:59.246 --> 00:02:01.047
financial dispute, Luna said his

00:02:01.181 --> 00:02:02.515
investigators have not yet drawn

00:02:02.515 --> 00:02:06.686
any conclusions.

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.055
&gt;&gt; I'm not here telling you it's

00:02:09.189 --> 00:02:10.557
a dispute over money yet.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.625
It's something we've heard to

00:02:11.758 --> 00:02:12.759
this point and it's something

00:02:12.892 --> 00:02:15.795
the detectives will go out and

00:02:15.929 --> 00:02:17.664
validate and see if it's true or

00:02:17.797 --> 00:02:17.931
not.

00:02:18.064 --> 00:02:19.299
Based on what I know at this

00:02:19.432 --> 00:02:21.001
time, the suspect had been at

00:02:21.134 --> 00:02:25.171
the bishop's house before doing

00:02:25.305 --> 00:02:25.972
work.

00:02:26.106 --> 00:02:27.974
So there was some kind of a --

00:02:28.108 --> 00:02:29.276
maybe a working relationship,

00:02:29.409 --> 00:02:32.545
but we're still trying to figure

00:02:32.545 --> 00:02:33.513
out what that relationship was.

00:02:33.647 --> 00:02:34.881
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Medina has not yet

00:02:35.015 --> 00:02:35.415
been charged.

00:02:35.548 --> 00:02:38.218
CNN is attempting to identify

00:02:38.551 --> 00:02:39.085
whether he has an attorney.

00:02:39.219 --> 00:02:40.553
You and I have covered so many

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.555
of these murder cases where you

00:02:42.555 --> 00:02:43.990
often hear from a family member

00:02:44.124 --> 00:02:46.559
or neighbor saying, yeah, this

00:02:46.559 --> 00:02:49.462
was a troubled person, they had

00:02:49.596 --> 00:02:50.563
a criminal past.

00:02:50.563 --> 00:02:51.965
We're hearing from numbers who

00:02:52.098 --> 00:02:53.733
say they were stunned that this

00:02:53.867 --> 00:02:57.804
man has been implicated in this

00:02:57.937 --> 00:02:58.571
murder.

00:02:58.705 --> 00:03:01.841
One telling kcal that Medina

00:03:01.975 --> 00:03:03.443
was, quote, your average

00:03:03.576 --> 00:03:03.777
grandpa.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.478
As investigators work to peace

00:03:05.612 --> 00:03:06.579
together what happened here and

00:03:06.579 --> 00:03:07.781
why, community members of all

00:03:07.914 --> 00:03:11.551
faiths in L.A. And across the

